Emoji artwork in this directory is from Twemoji (https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji,
assets/72x72/<codepoint>.png), copyright Twitter, Inc and other contributors,
licensed under CC-BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

These PNGs are build inputs only: mkemoji.c downsamples and palette-quantizes
them into emoji.bfnt, which is a modified (derived) form of that artwork.
Anything distributing emoji.bfnt or binaries using it should carry this credit.

Regenerate:  make -C _font install     (builds font.bfnt first; mkemoji reads its cell size)
